chuckcar wrote:
> Pets are more likely to leave corpses when they kill a critter than you.

No they aren't.

See corpse_chance() in mon.c, basically except for special cases
(liches/vlad/gas spores never leave a corpse, lizards/golems/player
monsters/the Riders always do) the only things that affect corpse
chances are a monster-specific "geno" flag, the monster's size, and
what level you're on (Rogue level=no corpses, graveyard levels=lower
chance of undead corpses).



